# Backend Layered Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph Controllers
    C1[EmployeRestController]
    C2[AttestationRestController]
    C3[ParametreController]
    C4[AuthController]
    C5[HrController]
  end

  subgraph Services
    S1[EmployeService]
    S2[AttestationServiceImpl]
    S3[ParametreService]
    S4[AttestationTemplateService]
    S5[AttestationTemplateMigrationService]
  end

  subgraph DataAccess[DAO / Repository]
    R1[EmployeRepository]
    R2[AttestationRepository]
    R3[ParametreRepository]
    R4[HrRepository]
    R5[AttestationTemplateRepository]
  end

  subgraph Infra
    DB[(MySQL)]
    JR[(JasperReports)]
    FS[[pdfs/ folder]]
  end

  %% Edges
  C1 --> S1
  C2 --> S2
  C3 --> S3
  C3 --> S4
  C3 --> S5
  C4 --> R4
  C5 --> R4

  S1 --> R1
  S2 --> R2
  S2 --> R1
  S2 --> JR
  S2 --> FS
  S3 --> R3
  S4 --> R5
  S5 --> R5

  R1 --> DB
  R2 --> DB
  R3 --> DB
  R4 --> DB
  R5 --> DB
```